Module arrives "Wolves on the sledge road" {
  Place reach "the Reach" is wilderness.
  Place road "the sledge road" is room within reach at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Place downs "the downs" is room within reach at 3, 3 outdoors.
  Passage track "the track up to the downs" is path between road and downs taking 20 minutes.
  Company party "You" of 1 at road.
  Person wolves "the wolves off the downs" at downs {
    Role "four of them, grey, lean as rakes". Species wolf. Numbers 4. Pronouns they. Temperament territorial.
    Arrives "Four grey shapes come down off the downs onto the ice, one behind another, and sit across the road.".
    Warns "The wolves get up, without hurry. One puts its head down, and you hear it: a sound like a saw in green wood.".
  }
  Relation came(place).
  // The module puts them on the road; the shared rules' warning comes after they are said to come.
  Rule wolves_come when watch(clock) >= 3 and not came(road) { Assert came(road). Assert at(wolves, road). }
  Observe road_scene at road when true "The sledge road runs on grey into the dark.".
  Goal false.
}
